      "snippet": "Visited here on a Sunday evening and it wasn't crowded at all. Located along the Hyderabad highway, there is ample parking space available. There is also a lodging facility.\nWe had the following: Raj Kachori, Litchi Mojito, Litchi milkshake, Tea, Coffee and Lime Soda. It took a lot of time for tea and coffee to be served. Despite being seated in the AC service section, the ambience was hot and the price wasn't justified for what we paid.\nThough the taste was good, the atmosphere inside wasn't pleasant due to no cooling.\nThere is a washroom and it is clean.",
      "extracted_snippet": {
        "original": "Visited here on a Sunday evening and it wasn't crowded at all. Located along the Hyderabad highway, there is ample parking space available. There is also a lodging facility.\nWe had the following: Raj Kachori, Litchi Mojito, Litchi milkshake, Tea, Coffee and Lime Soda. It took a lot of time for tea and coffee to be served. Despite being seated in the AC service section, the ambience was hot and the price wasn't justified for what we paid.\nThough the taste was good, the atmosphere inside wasn't pleasant due to no cooling.\nThere is a washroom and it is clean."
